### 6.1 PERC Overview

PERC (Programmable Electrical Rule Check) performs reliability-focused electrical verification including:
- ESD (Electrostatic Discharge) path verification
- Latch-up checks
- Voltage-aware DRC
- Current density checks
- Gate oxide integrity

